    mc "Por mais estranho que possa parecer, lembro-me de tudo."

# game/script8.rpy:2522
translate brazil jumpoff_1aabb45b:

#   mc "I knew I'd probably die if I jumped off the ship, but at the same time... I couldn't resist the overwhelming urge to do it."
    mc "Eu sabia que provavelmente morreria se saltasse do navio, mas ao mesmo tempo... não pude resistir à vontade irresistível de fazê-lo."

# game/script8.rpy:2523
translate brazil jumpoff_fdbba512:

#   mc "It's hard to explain, it was such a weird sensation."
    mc "É difícil explicar, foi uma sensação tão estranha."

# game/script8.rpy:2525
translate brazil jumpoff_88de75d1:

#   no "[mc]! I'm so glad you're back with us!" with dis
    no "[mc]! Estou tão feliz que você está de volta conosco!" with dis

# game/script8.rpy:2526
translate brazil jumpoff_9879a1ba:

#   mc "Nova!"
    mc "Nova!"

# game/script8.rpy:2528
translate brazil jumpoff_2a5eef39:

#   mc "All thanks to you two!" with dis12
    mc "Tudo graças a vocês dois!" with dis12

# game/script8.rpy:2529
translate brazil jumpoff_3eece341:

#   mc "Phew, it feels good to be back on solid ground again."
    mc "Ufa, é bom estar de volta à terra firme novamente."

# game/script8.rpy:2530
translate brazil jumpoff_79eccfe4:

#   mc "What happened after you knocked me out, exactly?"
    mc "O que aconteceu depois que você me nocauteou, exatamente?"

# game/script8.rpy:2532
translate brazil jumpoff_dedb9a76:

#   no "Well, with both you and Mr. Zap out of commission, Nancy took the wheel and we redirected the ship as fast as we could."
    no "Bem, com você e o Sr. Zap fora de serviço, Nancy assumiu o volante e redirecionamos o navio o mais rápido que pudemos."

# game/script8.rpy:2534
translate brazil jumpoff_6f98d772:

#   n "Those sirens didn't make it easy, though."
    n "Essas sirenes não facilitaram as coisas, no entanto."

# game/script8.rpy:2536
translate brazil jumpoff_9ad927ef:

#   no "Yeahhh... they kept popping up everywhere like {bt=3}{i}nyaaaaaaaaaah!{/i}{/bt} – trying to kill us both!"
    no "Yeahhh... eles continuaram aparecendo em todos os lugares como {bt=3}{i}nyaaaaaaaaaah!{/i}{/bt} – tentando matar nós dois!"

# game/script8.rpy:2538
translate brazil jumpoff_779eb8ec:

#   n "Women aren't affected by their singing, but those sharp nails of theirs can still slice a shark in half."
    n "As mulheres não são afetadas pelo seu canto, mas aquelas unhas afiadas ainda podem cortar um tubarão ao meio."

# game/script8.rpy:2540
translate brazil jumpoff_52247b52:

#   n "Although... I guess at least our fate is better than the men's." with dis
    n "Embora... eu acho que pelo menos o nosso destino é melhor que o dos homens." with dis

# game/script8.rpy:2542
translate brazil jumpoff_9ea9b561:

#   mc "What would have happened to me?"
    mc "O que teria acontecido comigo?"

# game/script8.rpy:2544
translate brazil jumpoff_0afc7a2d:

#   n "Well... according to the stories, the sirens lure men into the water, making them jump willingly." with dis
    n "Bem... segundo as histórias, as sirenes atraem os homens para a água, fazendo-os saltar de boa vontade." with dis

# game/script8.rpy:2546
translate brazil jumpoff_65a41f43:

#   no "Once they're in, they chop off their testicles and introduce them into their genital pores to fertilize their eggs, breeding dozens of new sirens."
    no "Uma vez dentro, eles cortam seus testículos e os introduzem nos poros genitais para fertilizar seus óvulos, criando dezenas de novas sereias."

# game/script8.rpy:2547
translate brazil jumpoff_42371fa7:

#   mc "T-They what?"
    mc "E-Eles o quê?"

# game/script8.rpy:2549
translate brazil jumpoff_c5b602b8:

#   n "Finally, if the man hasn't drowned by then, they decapitate him and feast on his flesh."
    n "Finalmente, se o homem ainda não tiver se afogado, eles o decapitam e festejam com sua carne."

# game/script8.rpy:2550
translate brazil jumpoff_9cfacad7:

#   n "All while still hearing their cursed melody..."
    n "Enquanto ainda ouvia sua maldita melodia..."

# game/script8.rpy:2552
translate brazil jumpoff_3e0470b7:

#   mc "*Gulps* T-That sounds pretty awful."
    mc "*Gulps* I-Isso parece horrível."

# game/script8.rpy:2553
translate brazil jumpoff_0cd64392:

#   n "Oh, you have no idea..."
    n "Ah, você não tem ideia..."

# game/script8.rpy:2555
translate brazil jumpoff_eaed195a:

#   n "Luckily for us, Nova's superhuman aim took out every single siren that tried to board the ship before they could even get close to us."
    n "Felizmente para nós, a mira sobre-humana de Nova destruiu todas as sirenes que tentaram embarcar no navio antes mesmo que pudessem chegar perto de nós."

# game/script8.rpy:2557
translate brazil jumpoff_259ae6eb:

#   no "*Giggles* Well, I wouldn't say {i}superhuman{/i}, but..."
    no "*Risos* Bem, eu não diria {i}sobre-humano{/i}, mas..."

# game/script8.rpy:2558
translate brazil jumpoff_d49c5cfe:

#   no "Hihi, I appreciate it, thank you."
    no "Olá, agradeço, obrigado."

# game/script8.rpy:2559
translate brazil jumpoff_767fca63:

#   mc "Yeah, I'm well aware of Nova's extraordinary skills."
    mc "Sim, estou bem ciente das habilidades extraordinárias de Nova."

# game/script8.rpy:2560
translate brazil jumpoff_646b4667:

#   no "*Giggles* Come on, guys, stop it!"
    no "*Risos* Vamos, pessoal, parem com isso!"

# game/script8.rpy:2562
translate brazil jumpoff_f2f59c32:

#   mc "*Chuckles* So... where are we now?" with dis
    mc "*Ri* Então... onde estamos agora?" with dis

# game/script8.rpy:2564
translate brazil jumpoff_f080d1af:

#   n "On the border between the Bay of the Undead and the Paradox Archipelago."
    n "Na fronteira entre a Baía dos Mortos-Vivos e o Arquipélago do Paradoxo."

# game/script8.rpy:2565
translate brazil jumpoff_a322c15e:

#   n "Our journey is almost over!"
    n "Nossa jornada está quase no fim!"

# game/script8.rpy:2567
translate brazil jumpoff_da132f4a:

#   mc "Seriously? We managed to avoid the Bay of the Undead?!"
    mc "Seriamente? Conseguimos evitar a Baía dos Mortos-Vivos?!"

# game/script8.rpy:2569
translate brazil jumpoff_ee52a743:

#   n "Yes! It was as simple as steering clear of their island."
    n "Sim! Era tão simples quanto sair da ilha deles."

# game/script8.rpy:2570
translate brazil jumpoff_7b311785:

#   n "Once we find our way out of this archipelago, we'll finally see the Island of the Lost Souls!"
    n "Assim que sairmos deste arquipélago, finalmente veremos a Ilha das Almas Perdidas!"

# game/script8.rpy:2572
translate brazil jumpoff_f861aa94:

#   mc "Oh, neat!"
    mc "Ah, legal!"

# game/script8.rpy:2574
translate brazil jumpoff_4885e8cd:

#   n "Compasses stop working in here, so Mr. Zap went to that old pirate post to find a high vantage point for..."
    n "As bússolas pararam de funcionar aqui, então o Sr. Zap foi até aquele antigo posto pirata para encontrar um ponto alto para..."

# game/script8.rpy:2576
translate brazil jumpoff_a7e4b100:

#   zap "Guys, over here!" with dissolve
    zap "Pessoal, aqui!" with dissolve

# game/script8.rpy:2578
translate brazil jumpoff_24efca81:

#   n "*Turning around* Oh, he's back!" with dis
    n "*Virando-se* Oh, ele está de volta!" with dis

# game/script8.rpy:2579
translate brazil jumpoff_68b089c8:

#   zap "Ah, good to see you safe and sound, Mr. [mc]!"
    zap "Ah, que bom ver você são e salvo, Sr. [mc]!"

# game/script8.rpy:2580
translate brazil jumpoff_0a3e6e10:

#   mc "Thank you, Zap!"
    mc "Obrigado, Zap!"

# game/script8.rpy:2581
translate brazil jumpoff_1de44af8:

#   zap "Now come over here, quick! I have juicy, juicy news!"
    zap "Agora venha aqui, rápido! Tenho notícias suculentas e suculentas!"

# game/script8.rpy:2582
translate brazil jumpoff_81ec3824:

#   mc "My favorite kind of news!"
    mc "Meu tipo favorito de notícia!"

# game/script8.rpy:2586
translate brazil jumpoff_3e230b28:

#   bla "You wade through the tidal pool of the bay and regroup with Zap on the abandoned but still intact dock." with dis
    bla "Você atravessa a piscina de maré da baía e se reagrupa com Zap na doca abandonada, mas ainda intacta." with dis

# game/script8.rpy:2589
translate brazil jumpoff_ca4e19b6:

#   mc "Alright, what did you find out?" with dis
    mc "Tudo bem, o que você descobriu?" with dis

# game/script8.rpy:2591
translate brazil jumpoff_8f73d102:

#   zap "I've made a crucial discovery, my friend. CRUCIAL!"
    zap "Fiz uma descoberta crucial, meu amigo. CRUCIAL!"

# game/script8.rpy:2592
translate brazil jumpoff_c1fe2a27:

#   zap "You know how the few sailors who made it to the Archipelago could never get past this point?"
    zap "Você sabe como os poucos marinheiros que chegaram ao Arquipélago nunca conseguiram passar desse ponto?"

# game/script8.rpy:2593
translate brazil jumpoff_e5bdefb3:

#   zap "I finally know why... it's the winds!"
    zap "Finalmente sei porquê... são os ventos!"

# game/script8.rpy:2595
translate brazil jumpoff_59329fe0:

#   no "The winds?"
    no "Os ventos?"

# game/script8.rpy:2597
translate brazil jumpoff_1f9823e2:

#   zap "The islands in the Archipelago form a circle, creating their own wind currents."
    zap "As ilhas do arquipélago formam um círculo, criando as suas próprias correntes de vento."

# game/script8.rpy:2598
translate brazil jumpoff_d0b11d0b:

#   zap "Without working compasses, sailors can't keep track of their direction and end up sailing in circles, thinking they're going straight!"
    zap "Sem bússolas funcionais, os marinheiros não conseguem acompanhar sua direção e acabam navegando em círculos, pensando que estão indo em linha reta!"

# game/script8.rpy:2599
translate brazil jumpoff_d787e415:

#   zap "That's why some of them even wound up back in Tortuga!"
    zap "É por isso que alguns deles acabaram em Tortuga!"

# game/script8.rpy:2601
translate brazil jumpoff_faf0fff6:

#   n "But... can't you navigate by the sky? Tracking the sun or the moon?"
    n "Mas... você não consegue navegar pelo céu? Rastreando o sol ou a lua?"

# game/script8.rpy:2603
translate brazil jumpoff_77a3ef52:

#   zap "Uh..."
    zap "Uh..."

# game/script8.rpy:2605
translate brazil jumpoff_ac375705:

#   zap "Erm... I'm not sure. The archipelago might create an optical illusion, making the sun appear to shift constantly..." with dis06
    zap "Erm... não tenho certeza. O arquipélago pode criar uma ilusão de ótica, fazendo com que o sol pareça mudar constantemente..." with dis06

# game/script8.rpy:2606
translate brazil jumpoff_3a383811:

#   zap "Or... perhaps they just weren't that good as sailors, I don't know."
    zap "Ou... talvez eles simplesmente não fossem tão bons marinheiros, não sei."

# game/script8.rpy:2608
translate brazil jumpoff_4b73adac:

#   zap "*Clears throat* But anyway, in any case, and as I was just saying, I know the solution." with dis
    zap "*Limpa a garganta* Mas de qualquer forma, em qualquer caso, e como acabei de dizer, eu sei a solução." with dis

# game/script8.rpy:2609
translate brazil jumpoff_e5531440:

#   zap "We need to trek across the main island on foot!"
    zap "Precisamos caminhar pela ilha principal a pé!"

# game/script8.rpy:2611
translate brazil jumpoff_4d546cdb:

#   no "What?"
    no "O que?"

# game/script8.rpy:2612
translate brazil jumpoff_6454daad:

#   no "We have to... hike through the jungle?"
    no "Temos que... caminhar pela selva?"

# game/script8.rpy:2614
translate brazil jumpoff_18d97c2e:

#   zap "I know what you're thinking: “isn't it dangerous, Mr. Zap?”"
    zap "Eu sei o que você está pensando: \"não é perigoso, Sr. Zap?\""

# game/script8.rpy:2615
translate brazil jumpoff_0a697fb5:

#   zap "Fear not, I happen to be an expert at navigating jungles."
    zap "Não tenha medo, sou um especialista em navegar nas selvas."

# game/script8.rpy:2617
translate brazil jumpoff_4af11b87:

#   mc "I thought you were an expert fisherman."
    mc "Achei que você fosse um pescador experiente."

# game/script8.rpy:2619
translate brazil jumpoff_665f5529:

#   zap "They're compatible."
    zap "Eles são compatíveis."

# game/script8.rpy:2621
translate brazil jumpoff_56b63f50:

#   n "I was actually wondering what ship we're gonna take from the other side of the island."
    n "Na verdade, estava me perguntando que navio levaríamos do outro lado da ilha."

# game/script8.rpy:2623
translate brazil jumpoff_18bd6517:

#   zap "Uh... there will likely be some boat there or something, I wouldn't worry about that."
    zap "Uh... provavelmente haverá algum barco lá ou algo assim, eu não me preocuparia com isso."

# game/script8.rpy:2625
translate brazil jumpoff_b9107783:

#   n "Eh..."
    n "Eh..."

# game/script8.rpy:2626
translate brazil jumpoff_102d2293:

#   n "Well, if you're so sure about it..."
    n "Bem, se você tem tanta certeza disso..."

# game/script8.rpy:2628
translate brazil jumpoff_f995aa8b:

#   zap "We've only got 4 hours left until the Island of the Lost Souls vanishes, so less chatter and more trekking!"
    zap "Faltam apenas 4 horas para a Ilha das Almas Perdidas desaparecer, então menos conversa e mais caminhada!"

# game/script8.rpy:2629
translate brazil jumpoff_53286e5a:

#   zap "Let's move!"
    zap "Vamos nos mover!"

# game/script8.rpy:2631
translate brazil jumpoff_82b4aac7:

#   mc "So... on a scale of 1 to 10, how sure are you about this plan of yours?"
    mc "Então... em uma escala de 1 a 10, o quanto você tem certeza desse seu plano?"

# game/script8.rpy:2632
translate brazil jumpoff_16843d93:

#   zap ". . ."
    zap ". . ."

# game/script8.rpy:2634
translate brazil jumpoff_373b7c91:

#   zap "About a 6."
    zap "Cerca de um 6."

# game/script8.rpy:2636
translate brazil jumpoff_77a89e99:

#   mc ". . ."
    mc ". . ."

# game/script8.rpy:2638
translate brazil jumpoff_6d4a9499:

#   zap "Look, I get it, [mc], you're scared." with dis
    zap "Olha, entendi, [mc], você está com medo." with dis

# game/script8.rpy:2640
translate brazil jumpoff_018740b6:

#   mc "I'm not scared."
    mc "Eu não estou com medo."

# game/script8.rpy:2642
translate brazil jumpoff_a48cfcca:

#   zap "But it's fear that held back every other pirate from grabbing that treasure."
    zap "Mas foi o medo que impediu todos os outros piratas de agarrar esse tesouro."

# game/script8.rpy:2643
translate brazil jumpoff_61efb283:

#   zap "We've gotta stick together, stay strong."
    zap "Temos que ficar juntos, permanecer fortes."

# game/script8.rpy:2644
translate brazil jumpoff_f9f4971b:

#   zap "I've helmed my own ship for 15 years."
    zap "Dirigi meu próprio navio por 15 anos."

# game/script8.rpy:2645
