#   mc "*Chuckles* Oh, I see..."
    mc "*Ri* Ah, entendo..."

# game/script8.rpy:16302
translate brazil arabialogoff_358ae3fb:

#   mc "I thought that's how you liked it."
    mc "Achei que era assim que você gostava."

# game/script8.rpy:16304
translate brazil arabialogoff_6109917f:

#   d "Oh, I do... but that doesn't avoid awkward questions."
    d "Ah, sim... mas isso não evita perguntas embaraçosas."

# game/script8.rpy:16306
